WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:24.724
A BIG EMPTY PARKING LOT YOU CAN
COME SIT IN FOR A SEC.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.861
WITH OVER 500 EMPTY SPOTS AS FAR
AS THE ICAHN SEE, TARGET'S

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:31.197
PARKING LOT IS THE PERFECT PLACE
TO STARE OUT, BANG YOUR HEAD ON

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:34.934
YOUR STEERING WHEEL, OR TEXT A
FRIEND, I HONESTLY CAN'T WITH

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
THEM TODAY.
YOU CAN EVEN PUT YOUR SEAT ALL

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE WAY FLAT AND THEN PUT IT
BACK UP AGAIN.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:44.177
THAT TOOK A COUPLE SECONDS.
OR TURN OFF YOUR CAR'S IGNITION

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND LOOK AT YOUR BREATH FOR A
WHILE.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.949
AND WHILE YOU'RE THERE, WHY NOT
MAKE EYE CONTACT WITH A STRANGER

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.519
IN ANOTHER CAR?
AND WITHOUT EITHER OF YOU SAYING

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:55.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
A WORD, COMMUNICATE THE ENTIRE
STORY OF YOUR DAY.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
WANT TO KILL MORE TIME?
HEAD INSIDE.

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:03.396
YOU CAN WANDER A CLOTHES AISLE
AND THINK TO YOURSELF, OH, YEAH,

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:06.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
MASAMO.
PLOP DOWN BY THE BRAS AND ADD

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.602
RANDOM NUMBERS ON YOUR CALCULATE
LETTER OR GO TO OUR TOY SECTION

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:13.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND JUST LAY DOWN BACK THERE.
AND HERE'S A TIP.

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.909 size:88% position:44%
CHECK OUT THE PLAY-DOH.
OPEN THE BLUE ONE AND --

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:19.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
SURPRISE, WE HID A FLASK IN
THERE FOR YOU.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
BOTTOMS UP, GIRL, YOU DESERVE
IT.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.751
SO THIS THANKSGIVING, TELL YOUR
PARENTS YOU'RE GOING TO GRAB

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:28.088
SOMETHING FROM TARGET REAL
QUICK, COME KICK IT, THEN GO

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
HOME AND TELL THEM THEY DIDN'T
HAVE IT.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:33.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT WILL BE OUR LITTLE SECRET.
TARGET.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:36.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUY YOURSELF SOME TIME.
&gt;&gt; YOU DO HAVE TO PAY FOR ALL

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:37.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS, THOUGH.
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.065 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

